<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Manugistics started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Manugistics started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Everen Securities analyst William Lanzon said he started coverage of Manugistics Group Inc with a 2-1 rating, or market performer intermediate-term and outperform long-term, for aggressive investors.</p>
<p>--Shares in the supply chain management software concern were unchanged at 43-1/4 bid and 43-5/8 ask.</p>
<p>--&quot;We feel that the company can trade at 4.0 times the S&amp;P 500 multiple, which leads to a long-term price target of $61, and an intermediate term price target of $48,&quot; Lanzon said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
